{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012rgbvxWTSNKNe7FmcVf237","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Northside lending app\n2\t\n3\tThis is the app the Northside Tool Library desk runs on. It has a catalogue page, a JSON API and a desk\n4\tCLI. It stores everything in one SQLite file, built from the data in `seed/`.\n5\t\n6\t## Folders\n7\t\n8\t| Folder         | Holds                                                     |\n9\t| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n10\t| `src/fees/`    | late fees and damage charge splits, in integer cents      |\n11\t| `src/loans/`   | due dates and reservations                                |\n12\t| `src/members/` | member search                                             |\n13\t| `src/items/`   | who may borrow what                                       |\n14\t| `src/auth/`    | desk roles; protected, a coordinator reviews every change |\n15\t| `tests/`       | `bun test` runs them; the gate runs them too              |\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"69731084-f4db-49de-ac0b-b241bf229bd6","uuid":"db4e6729-0736-4c51-9b2d-053aca9b1e72","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:06:01.642Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/software-factory-claude-code/parts/06-price-and-ship/03-ship-the-factory/solution/runs/1/repo/README.md","content":"# Northside lending app\n\nThis is the app the Northside Tool Library desk runs on. It has a catalogue page, a JSON API and a desk\nCLI. It stores everything in one SQLite file, built from the data in `seed/`.\n\n## Folders\n\n| Folder         | Holds                                                     |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `src/fees/`    | late fees and damage charge splits, in integer cents      |\n| `src/loans/`   | due dates and reservations                                |\n| `src/members/` | member search                    